<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Oil 1997 turnaround schedule.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Oil 1997 turnaround schedule.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Oil Co Ltd said on Friday that its schedule for routine maintenance closures of its crude distillation units (CDUs) in 1997 is as follows (capacity in barrels per day):</p>
<p>	CDU		     CAPACITY	CLOSURE SCHEDULE</p>
<p>    Kawasaki		   75,000	 from September</p>
<p>    Mizushima 2	     100,000	     none</p>
<p>    Mizushima 3	     150,000	   May - June</p>
</text>
